// One individual flashcard teaching lesson per card (owner doctrine: Learning
// Path = HOW to learn). Each lesson opens on its own /learn/{slug}/ page: the
// original Canva flashcard on the left, this step-by-step teaching content on
// the right, NO drawing canvas anywhere. Content is written fresh for teaching
